title: Aglio e Olio
author: Ava Taylor
course: Side Dishes
method: stovetop
source: https://cheframsayrecipes.com/gordon-ramsay-aglio-olio-recipe/
protein: none
servings: 2 servings
cook time: 10 minutes
prep time: 5 minutes
time required: 15 minutes
alternative_name: Gordon Ramsay Aglio Olio Recipe
ingredient_count: 4
---

Cook @spaghetti{250%g} in a large #pot of salted boiling water until al dente. Reserve @reserved pasta water{1/2%cup} before draining.

In a #skillet, heat @extra virgin olive oil{1/4%cup} over medium. Add @garlic{5%cloves}(thinly sliced) and toast gently until golden—don't let it brown.

Sprinkle in @red pepper flakes{1/2%tsp} and let them sizzle for ~{10%seconds} to flavor the oil.

Add drained spaghetti to the #skillet and toss to coat evenly in garlic oil.

Pour in reserved pasta water gradually, tossing until a silky sauce forms.

Season with @salt{to taste}, add @?parsley{1%tbsp}(chopped fresh) or @?parmesan{} or pecorino{}(grated) if desired, and serve immediately.